contentText:
BTS gave ARMY permission to dance for the first of many times on the band&#8217;s world tour supporting ARIRANG , which kicked off Thursday (April 9) with a spectacular performance at Goyang Stadium in South Korea. And in a sweet post on Weverse, Jin summed up his happiness surrounding the night.

